#: app/templates/add_media.html:70
msgid "These details do not overwrite an existing duplicate or an item promoted from your wishlist."
msgstr "这些详情不会覆盖已有重复条目或从心愿单移入收藏的条目的原有详情。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:75
msgid "Search details changed. The displayed preview, save and manual actions are disabled. Search or continue again to prepare new actions."
msgstr "搜索详情已更改。当前显示的预览、保存和手动操作已禁用。请再次点击“搜索或继续”，以准备新的操作。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:78
msgid "Choose Add or Wishlist, a concrete format and a search method. Search, compare, review and save here; no specialist page is required."
msgstr "请选择加入收藏或心愿单、具体格式和搜索方式。你可以在此搜索、比较、确认并保存，无需前往专用页面。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:79
msgid "This page shows text only and does not load or download artwork. You can add artwork later."
msgstr "此页面仅显示文本，不加载或下载封面图片。你可以稍后添加封面图片。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:84
msgid "Check this action"
msgstr "检查此操作"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:86
msgid "The form could not be accepted. Review the fields or start a new search."
msgstr "无法接受此表单。请检查各字段，或重新搜索。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:87
msgid "Check the format, method, provider and field values. ISBNs and retail barcodes must have valid check digits; catalogue numbers are not barcodes."
msgstr "请检查格式、方式、数据提供方和字段值。ISBN 和零售条形码的校验位必须有效；唱片编号不是条形码。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:88
msgid "This form requires ordinary URL-encoded text, not an upload or attachment. Start a new search."
msgstr "此表单只接受普通的 URL 编码文本，不接受文件上传或附件。请重新搜索。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:89
msgid "The submitted form is too large. Shorten the details or start a new search."
msgstr "提交的表单数据过大。请精简详情，或重新搜索。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:90
msgid "The page address is too long. Open Add media again."
msgstr "页面地址过长。请重新打开“添加媒体”页面。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:91
msgid "Your sign-in or editing permission changed. Open Add media again before continuing."
msgstr "你的登录状态或编辑权限已更改。请重新打开“添加媒体”页面后再继续。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:92
msgid "This selection or review expired or changed. Search and preview again before saving."
msgstr "所选结果或确认内容已过期或发生变化。请在保存前重新搜索并预览。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:93
msgid "The captured Add or Wishlist details no longer match this action. Search and preview again."
msgstr "已记录的“加入收藏或心愿单”详情与此操作不再匹配。请重新搜索并预览。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:94
msgid "The provider release does not match the selected format. Choose the correct format and search again; the release will not be relabelled."
msgstr "数据提供方的发行版本与所选格式不匹配。请选择正确格式并重新搜索；系统不会更改该发行版本的格式标记。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:95
#: app/templates/fragments/add_media_receipt.html:12
msgid "The save outcome is unknown. Check your library before submitting again; do not automatically retry this save."
msgstr "保存结果未知。再次提交前，请先检查你的资料库；不要自动重试此次保存。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:96
msgid "This action could not be completed. Review the details and start a new search."
msgstr "无法完成此操作。请检查详情并重新搜索。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:98
msgid "Review search details"
msgstr "检查搜索详情"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:98
msgid "Start again"
msgstr "重新开始"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:103
msgid "The item was saved, but follow-up activity could not be recorded. Check the saved item before submitting again."
msgstr "条目已保存，但无法记录后续活动。再次提交前，请先检查已保存的条目。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:108
msgid "Search or prepare manual entry"
msgstr "搜索或准备手动录入"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:114
msgid "Add or Wishlist"
msgstr "加入收藏或心愿单"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:116
msgid "Choose Add or Wishlist"
msgstr "选择加入收藏或心愿单"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:122
msgid "Concrete format"
msgstr "具体格式"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:124
msgid "Choose a format"
msgstr "选择格式"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:127
msgid "A format is required. No automatic book search or format conversion is performed."
msgstr "必须选择格式。系统不会自动搜索图书，也不会转换格式。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:130
msgid "Search method"
msgstr "搜索方式"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:132
msgid "Choose a method"
msgstr "选择方式"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:135
msgid "ISBN is for book formats; catalogue number is for music. Manual entry does not contact a provider."
msgstr "ISBN 用于图书格式；唱片编号用于音乐。手动录入不会联系数据提供方。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:138
msgid "Music search provider"
msgstr "音乐搜索数据提供方"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:140
msgid "Choose a provider"
msgstr "选择数据提供方"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:143
msgid "For non-music formats choose Automatic. Automatic keeps MusicBrainz first, with Discogs fallback only for a successful empty cassette search with both title and artist. Discogs only searches Discogs directly, including catalogue-only searches, without a MusicBrainz fallback."
msgstr "非音乐格式请选择“自动”。“自动”优先使用 MusicBrainz；仅当同时提供标题和艺术家的卡式磁带搜索成功完成但结果为空时，才会转而使用 Discogs。“仅使用 Discogs”会直接搜索 Discogs，也支持只按唱片编号搜索，不会转而使用 MusicBrainz。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:147 app/templates/add_media.html:150
msgid "Title or identifier"
msgstr "标题或标识符"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:150
msgid "Title (optional)"
msgstr "标题（选填）"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:155
msgid "Use the selected method. Enter catalogue numbers as printed, with artist or title hints when known; a short numeric catalogue code is not a barcode or provider release ID. For manual entry, search text may be left blank."
msgstr "请使用所选方式。唱片编号应按实物上印制的内容输入，并在已知时补充艺术家或标题线索；较短的纯数字唱片编号不是条形码，也不是数据提供方的发行版本 ID。手动录入时可将搜索文本留空。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:156
msgid "Title, artist and title hint: up to 200 characters; catalogue number: 100; ISBN or retail barcode: 32."
msgstr "标题、艺术家和标题线索：各最多 200 个字符；唱片编号：最多 100 个字符；ISBN 或零售条形码：最多 32 个字符。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:159
msgid "Artist (music, optional)"
msgstr "艺术家（音乐，选填）"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:163
msgid "Title hint (music identifiers, optional)"
msgstr "标题线索（按音乐标识符搜索时使用，选填）"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:167
#: app/templates/fragments/add_media_manual.html:32
msgid "Game platform (optional)"
msgstr "游戏平台（选填）"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:169
#: app/templates/fragments/add_media_manual.html:34
msgid "Any or unknown platform"
msgstr "任意或未知平台"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:172
msgid "A platform can filter title search only when the provider supports it. Unsupported filters are refused, not silently applied."
msgstr "只有在数据提供方支持时，才能用平台筛选按标题搜索的结果。不受支持的筛选条件会被拒绝，不会在未提示的情况下应用。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:175
msgid "Country or region (music, optional)"
msgstr "国家或地区（音乐，选填）"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:177
msgid "Automatic and MusicBrainz require a two-letter ASCII country code. Discogs also accepts a region name, up to 80 characters."
msgstr "“自动”和 MusicBrainz 要求使用两个 ASCII 字母组成的国家代码。Discogs 也接受地区名称，最多 80 个字符。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:180
msgid "TV series, digital video and magazines have no catalogue lookup here. Choose Manual entry and continue to enter known details without a provider search."
msgstr "此处不提供电视剧、数字视频和杂志的目录查询。请选择“手动录入”并继续填写已知详情，无需向数据提供方搜索。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:181
msgid "Music matching is turned off. Music can still be entered manually without claiming an exact pressing."
msgstr "音乐匹配已关闭。你仍可手动录入音乐，但这并不表示已确认具体发行版本。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:182
msgid "All controls are shown without JavaScript. Leave inapplicable refinements blank, use Automatic for non-music formats, and submit Search or continue after changing intent. Prepared actions below keep their own captured intent."
msgstr "未启用 JavaScript 时会显示全部控件。请将不适用的筛选项留空，非音乐格式选择“自动”，更改操作设置后点击“搜索或继续”提交。下方已准备好的操作仍使用各自已记录的设置。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:183
msgid "Search or continue"
msgstr "搜索或继续"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:184
msgid "Only submitting this form starts a search. Typing or changing a choice does not contact providers."
msgstr "只有提交此表单才会开始搜索。输入内容或更改选项不会联系数据提供方。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:191
msgid "Search outcome"
msgstr "搜索结果"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:193
msgid "This lookup requires a configured provider credential. Enter known details manually instead."
msgstr "此查询需要先配置数据提供方凭据。请改为手动录入已知详情。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:194
msgid "The provider rejected this request. This is not an empty catalogue result. You can enter details manually."
msgstr "数据提供方拒绝了此次请求。这并不是目录查询结果为空。你可以手动录入详情。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:195
msgid "The provider rate limit was reached. No automatic retry is made. You can search later or enter details manually."
msgstr "已达到数据提供方的请求频率限制。系统不会自动重试。你可以稍后搜索，或手动录入详情。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:196
msgid "The provider search could not be completed. This does not mean there are no matching editions. You can enter details manually."
msgstr "无法完成数据提供方搜索。这并不表示没有匹配的版本。你可以手动录入详情。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:197
msgid "The search timed out. No automatic retry is made. You can enter details manually or deliberately search again."
msgstr "搜索已超时。系统不会自动重试。你可以手动录入详情，也可以主动重新搜索。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:198
msgid "No matching releases were returned for this search. Check the printed facts or enter details manually."
msgstr "此次搜索未返回匹配的发行版本。请核对实物上印制的信息，或手动录入详情。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:199
msgid "Catalogue lookup is not supported for this format. Enter known details manually; no provider search is needed."
msgstr "此格式不支持目录查询。请手动录入已知详情，无需向数据提供方搜索。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:200
msgid "No usable results were returned, or the selected details could not be read. Refine the search explicitly or enter known details manually."
msgstr "未返回可用结果，或无法读取所选详情。请明确调整搜索条件，或手动录入已知详情。"

#: app/templates/add_media.html:202
msgid "Use manual entry below"
msgstr "使用下方的手动录入"

